  "interpretation": "In the TB-A01 editorial-fashion transfer context, removing the phrase `8K masterpiece` while retaining `Ultra-detailed.` produced no change in the primary photographic_rendering_quality mean, semantic compliance, or technical-defect cleanliness. The removal condition scored 0.50 lower on aesthetic quality and 0.125 lower overall. This weakly supports the narrow hypothesis that `8K masterpiece` contributes little to core visible photographic rendering in an already well-specified production-like prompt, while the secondary aesthetic decrease prevents a stronger redundancy claim.",
